    "updated_at": "2021-05-03T18:28:08Z",
    "body": "The `vagrant` module will only display by default if there is a `Vagrantfile` in the current directory. Is this the case here?\r\n\r\nIn general:\r\nIf you don't need the module you can disable it with:\r\n```toml\r\n[vagrant]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n```\r\nIf you want the module to show up you can set `command_timeout` to a higher value to give it more time to execute like this:\r\n```toml\r\ncommand_timeout = 1000\r\n```",
